<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description"
    content="Learn about Mother Teresa Public School's history, vision, mission, and achievements in education.">
  <title>
    <%= title %>
  </title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="/css/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <section class="page-header">
      <div class="container">
        <h1><i class="fas fa-info-circle me-3"></i>About Us</h1>
        <p>Discover the story, vision, and values of Mother Teresa Public School</p>
        <div class="breadcrumb-custom">
          <a href="/">Home</a> <span>/</span> <span>About Us</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- School History -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Journey</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
        <p class="section-subtitle">A proud history of educating generations</p>

        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
            <div class="timeline">
              <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-year">The Beginning</div>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Mother Teresa Public School was established in Congress Muhalla, Mahnar,
                  Vaishali, Bihar with a vision to provide quality education to the children of the region. Starting
                  with just a handful of students, the school began its journey of excellence.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-year">Growth & Development</div>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Over the years, the school expanded its infrastructure, added new classrooms,
                  a computer lab, library, and playground. The number of students grew significantly, reflecting the
                  trust of parents in our institution.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-year">Modern Era</div>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">Today, MTPS stands as one of the leading schools in the Mahnar region,
                  equipped with smart classrooms, highly qualified faculty with 20+ years of experience, and a
                  comprehensive curriculum that focuses on
                  both academic excellence and personality development.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item animate-on-scroll">
                <div class="timeline-year">Looking Ahead</div>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted">We continue to innovate and improve, integrating technology into education
                  and preparing our students for a rapidly changing world while keeping our core values intact.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Vision & Mission -->
    <section class="section section-gray">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row g-4">
          <div class="col-lg-6 animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="custom-card h-100">
              <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="card-icon"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i></div>
                <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">Our Vision</h3>
                <p class="text-muted mb-0" style="line-height:1.9;">
                  To be a center of educational excellence that inspires students to become
                  responsible global citizens, critical thinkers, and compassionate individuals.
                  We envision a school where every child discovers their potential and develops
                  the skills needed to lead a successful and meaningful life.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 animate-on-scroll">
            <div class="custom-card h-100">
              <div class="card-body p-4">
                <div class="card-icon yellow"><i class="fas fa-bullseye"></i></div>
                <h3 style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">Our Mission</h3>
                <ul class="text-muted mb-0" style="line-height:2.2;">
                  <li>Provide quality education accessible to all sections of society</li>
                  <li>Foster creativity, critical thinking, and problem-solving skills</li>
                  <li>Develop strong moral values and ethical behavior in students</li>
                  <li>Create a safe, inclusive, and supportive learning environment</li>
                  <li>Integrate modern technology with traditional teaching methods</li>
                  <li>Encourage participation in sports, arts, and community service</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Director's Message -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">निदेशक का संदेश (Director's Message)</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>

        <div class="principal-section animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4 mb-md-0">
              <div
                style="width:180px; height:180px; border-radius:50%; margin:0 auto; overflow:hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); background-color: var(--white); border: 4px solid var(--primary-light);">
                <!-- Replace src with actual uploaded image path like /images/director.jpg if saved -->
                <img src="/images/director.png" alt="Bechu Prasad Sah"
                  style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position: top;"
                  onerror="this.onerror=null; this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div style=\'width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));\'><i class=\'fas fa-user-tie\' style=\'font-size:5rem; color:var(--white);\'></i></div>';" />
              </div>
              <h5 class="mt-3 mb-0" style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">श्री बेचू प्रसाद साह
              </h5>
              <p class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">निदेशक (40+ Years Experience), साहित्य
                अलंकार (हिंदी साहित्य)
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-9">
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight: 500;">
                प्रिय अभिभावकों और प्यारे विद्यार्थियों,
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                मदर टेरेसा पब्लिक स्कूल में आपका स्वागत है। हमारा विद्यालय एक ऐसा पोषणकारी वातावरण प्रदान करने के लिए
                प्रतिबद्ध है जहाँ हर बच्चा अपनी अद्वितीय क्षमता की खोज कर सके। शिक्षा का मूल उद्देश्य केवल किताबी ज्ञान
                तक सीमित नहीं है, बल्कि यह एक ऐसा माध्यम है जो बच्चों के सर्वांगीण विकास और चरित्र निर्माण में सहायक
                होता है। हमारा सदैव यह प्रयास रहा है कि हम अपने विद्यार्थियों को एक ऐसा सुरक्षित और प्रेरणादायक वातावरण
                प्रदान करें जहाँ वे न केवल शैक्षणिक श्रेष्ठता प्राप्त करें, बल्कि उच्च नैतिक मूल्यों को भी आत्मसात
                करें।
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                <strong>'साहित्य अलंकार'</strong> होने के नाते मेरा स्पष्ट विचार है कि हमारी भाषा और हमारी संस्कृति ही
                हमारी सच्ची पहचान है। तकनीकी और आधुनिक शिक्षा के इस युग में हमें अपनी जड़ों से जुड़े रहना अत्यंत आवश्यक
                है। हमारी संस्था का यह संकल्प है कि हम बच्चों को विश्व स्तरीय ज्ञान के साथ-साथ संस्कारवान भी बनाएँ।
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                मुझे पूर्ण विश्वास है कि हमारे योग्य शिक्षक, समर्पित प्रबंधन और आप सभी अभिभावकों के निरंतर सहयोग से हम
                मदर टेरेसा पब्लिक स्कूल को शिक्षा के क्षेत्र में नई ऊंचाइयों तक ले जाएंगे। आइए, मिलकर अपने बच्चों के
                उज्ज्वल और सुरक्षित भविष्य का निर्माण करें।
              </p>
              <p class="mb-0 mt-3" style="color:var(--primary); font-weight:600; font-style:italic; font-size:1.1rem;">
                "शिक्षा जीवन का आधार है, और संस्कार इसका आभूषण।"
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Principal's Message -->
    <section class="section section-gray">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">From the Principal's Desk</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>

        <div class="principal-section animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4 mb-md-0">
              <div
                style="width:180px; height:180px; border-radius:50%; margin:0 auto; overflow:hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); background-color: var(--white); border: 4px solid var(--primary-light);">
                <img src="\images\pramod.jpg" alt="Pramod Kumar Rai"
                  style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position: top;"
                  onerror="this.onerror=null; this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div style=\'width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));\'><i class=\'fas fa-user-tie\' style=\'font-size:5rem; color:var(--white);\'></i></div>';" />
              </div>
              <h5 class="mt-3 mb-0" style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">Pramod Kumar Rai</h5>
              <p class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Principal (20+ Years Experience) &
                Sahityaalankar (English Literature)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-9">
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight: 500;">
                Dear Parents and Students,
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                Welcome to Mother Teresa Public School. Our institution is dedicated to creating an environment where
                academic excellence and character building go hand in hand. Education is the most powerful tool to
                change the world, and at MTPS, we strive to build a solid foundation of knowledge, character, and
                resilience.
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                As a student of literature, I firmly believe that every child is a unique story waiting to be written.
                Literature teaches us empathy, broadens our horizons, and connects us to the shared human experience.
                Similarly, our educational approach aims to nurture not just academic proficiency, but holistic
                development. We encourage our students to read widely, think critically, and articulate their thoughts
                with confidence.
              </p>
              <p style="color:#555; line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                Our dedicated faculty ensures that our students are compassionate, socially responsible, and completely
                ready to face global challenges. I invite you to join our vibrant learning community.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-0 mt-3" style="color:var(--primary); font-weight:600; font-style:italic; font-size:1.1rem;">
                "Education is the kindling of a flame, not the filling of a vessel."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Senior Faculty's Words -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Words from Senior Faculty</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>

        <div class="principal-section animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4 mb-md-0">
              <div
                style="width:180px; height:180px; border-radius:50%; margin:0 auto; overflow:hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); background-color: var(--white); border: 4px solid var(--primary-light);">
                <img src="/images/senior_faculty.jpg" alt="Ranjit Kumar Malakar"
                  style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position: top;"
                  onerror="this.onerror=null; this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div style=\'width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));\'><i class=\'fas fa-chalkboard-teacher\' style=\'font-size:5rem; color:var(--white);\'></i></div>';" />
              </div>
              <h5 class="mt-3 mb-0" style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">Ranjit Kumar Malakar
              </h5>
              <p class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Senior Faculty (20+ Years Experience),
                Mother Teresa Public
                School</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-9">
              <p style="color:#555; line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                A school is more than just bricks and mortar; it is a thriving community of learners. Having served as a
                Senior Faculty member at MTPS for over 20 years, I have witnessed the incredible metamorphosis of our
                students over the
                years.
              </p>
              <p style="color:#555; line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                Our educational focus remains deeply rooted in experiential learning, where curiosity is celebrated and
                innovation is consistently nurtured. We strive to create a classroom environment where students feel
                safe to ask questions, explore new ideas, and make mistakes as part of their learning journey.
              </p>
              <p style="color:#555; line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                We are passionately committed to shaping minds that are not only sharp in intellect but also profoundly
                rich in human values.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-0 mt-3" style="color:var(--primary); font-weight:600; font-style:italic; font-size:1.1rem;">
                "Teaching is not about answering all the questions, but inspiring the desire to find them."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Co-ordinator's Words -->
    <section class="section section-gray">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Message from Co-ordinator</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>

        <div class="principal-section animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-md-3 text-center mb-4 mb-md-0">
              <div
                style="width:180px; height:180px; border-radius:50%; margin:0 auto; overflow:hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); background-color: var(--white); border: 4px solid var(--primary-light);">
                <img src="/images/coordinator.jpg" alt="Anil Kumar Sharma"
                  style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position: top;"
                  onerror="this.onerror=null; this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div style=\'width:100%; height:100%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary), var(--primary-light));\'><i class=\'fas fa-user-cog\' style=\'font-size:5rem; color:var(--white);\'></i></div>';" />
              </div>
              <h5 class="mt-3 mb-0" style="font-family:var(--font-heading); color:var(--primary);">Anil Kumar Sharma
              </h5>
              <p class="text-muted" style="font-size:0.85rem; font-weight: 600;">Co-ordinator (35+ Years Experience)</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-9">
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                At Mother Teresa Public School, our vision is seamlessly integrated into every aspect of school life. As
                the Co-ordinator, my primary focus is ensuring that the academic flow, administrative processes, and
                student welfare function harmoniously together.
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                We strongly believe that open communication between parents, teachers, and school administration is the
                cornerstone of a child's success. We ensure that our curriculum is engaging and that a balance is
                maintained between rigorous academics and invigorating extracurricular activities.
              </p>
              <p style="color:var(--gray); line-height:1.9; font-size:1.05rem;">
                My ongoing commitment is to provide a smooth, supportive, and effective educational framework that
                empowers both our dedicated teachers to teach at their best and our brilliant students to learn without
                limits.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-0 mt-3" style="color:var(--primary); font-weight:600; font-style:italic; font-size:1.1rem;">
                "Excellence is never an accident; it is the result of continuous coordination and sincere effort."
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Achievements -->
    <section class="section section-gray">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title">Our Achievements</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
        <p class="section-subtitle">Milestones that make us proud</p>

        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
            <div class="achievement-item animate-on-scroll">
              <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-trophy"></i></div>
              <div>
                <h6 class="mb-1" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);">Academic Excellence Award</h6>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">Recognized for outstanding academic results and
                  teaching quality by the district education board.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="achievement-item animate-on-scroll">
              <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-medal"></i></div>
              <div>
                <h6 class="mb-1" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);">100% Pass Rate</h6>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">Consistently achieved 100% pass rate in board
                  examinations with many students scoring distinction.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="achievement-item animate-on-scroll">
              <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-running"></i></div>
              <div>
                <h6 class="mb-1" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);">District Sports Champions</h6>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">Our students have won multiple medals in district
                  and state-level sports competitions.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="achievement-item animate-on-scroll">
              <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-paint-brush"></i></div>
              <div>
                <h6 class="mb-1" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);">Cultural Event Winners</h6>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">Regular participation and victories in inter-school
                  cultural competitions, debates, and science exhibitions.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="achievement-item animate-on-scroll">
              <div class="achievement-icon"><i class="fas fa-heart"></i></div>
              <div>
                <h6 class="mb-1" style="font-family:var(--font-heading);">Community Service Award</h6>
                <p class="mb-0 text-muted" style="font-size:0.9rem;">Recognized for organizing community service
                  programs, cleanliness drives, and environmental awareness campaigns.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
      <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
      <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>

</html>